        "note": "This repository extracts the proof dependency closure of the three corrected existence theorems from the larger development and ports it to the selected Lean toolchain. The original source checkpoint is 9cdc7dad5e84da878959fc382b2a0c852a93b874. The proof source is included here; access to that development repository is not needed to build this one.",
