      {
        "identifier": "https://github.com/scottnarmstrong/DeGiorgi",
        "note": "Scott Armstrong and Julia Kempe's formalization of De Giorgi–Nash–Moser theory (companion paper https://arxiv.org/abs/2604.05984) informed the bare-function Lp/Sobolev design and smooth-estimate-to-density strategy. We adapted weighted_power_mean_setIntegral from DeGiorgi/Poincare.lean and eLpNorm_const_average_le from DeGiorgi/SobolevPoincare.lean for the periodic analysis. The referenced source snapshot is 4c1b3077d3782b24065184df4ba59501b2e56fc7. Adapted proofs are included here with their attribution; DeGiorgi is not a Lean dependency.",
